  "releaseNotes": "Let a run say how far it has come\nFinish the crypto gateway: fewer questions of the node, and a home for its settings\nTake USDT without a middleman\nMake the AI ask for a file, a schema and a number the way it should\nCharge the cloud tester by the minute it holds a machine\nDrop the prompts the article drafts used\nTake the article drafts out\nMake the chat a place to read, and let a question ask for a diagram\nGive the site chat a subject, the way each channel already has one\nMake the chat page readable, and let it answer an empty wallet\nShow deploy targets by the kind of thing they are\nUpdated Ecng.Licensing to 1.0.85.\nUpdated Ecng.Net to 1.0.538.\nUpdated StockSharp.Messages to 5.0.245.",
